{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>阿富汗庫納爾省一所中學附近發生爆炸，至少10人死亡，超過110人受傷。</p><p></p><p>事發後，不斷有傷者送院，病房內不少傷者都是兒童。爆炸發生在周六上午10時中學附近一棟房屋內，阿富汗當局指，屋內堆有用於採礦和爆破作業的炸藥，相信意外是由這些炸藥引致。</p><p></p><p>據報道，採礦業是阿富汗的支柱產業，但礦業公司的安全標準往往較低，導致事故頻發。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:40:38.640219+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:54:10.585002+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T15:34:01.101636+00:00","content_hash":"b55e5d3dc7d47d999bd4d456923e4cfe3c1c6d59bb384b6c7e6c6d69ec3d4915","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:40:38.640219+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}